  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.29 Plan of correction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.29 “Plan of correction” means a written representation of a revised policy or practice that reflects how a licensee will correct one or more violations of applicable law to come into compliance with applicable law.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24",
